Option A — Paron as a PayPal-funded offline wallet

- User funds their Paron wallet through PayPal Sandbox.
- Paron records the credited funds and reserves part of the balance for offline spending.
- The app authorizes local payments using signed tokens and receipts.
- On reconnection, Paron reconciles receipts and determines which transactions are eligible for settlement.

